          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="211d-dbee-a463-64b2" name="Virtue of the Joust" hidden="false">
              <description>&apos;Great was Duke Folgar of Artois&apos; skill with a lance - none could unhorse hint, save perhaps Landuin himself&apos;

The Knight may re-roll failed rolls to hit when charging and using a lance (including magical lances).</description>
            </rule>
